  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build a small business for families in Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Building a small business for families in Cambodia&quot; is a campaign that aims to help families in rural Cambodia raise chickens to create a sustainable, continuous income that supports them in meeting their basic needs and allows them to be more self-reliant. Donations will provide the startup costs and counseling on successful chicken raising and small business management. By providing startup capital, materials and support, these families can improve their livelihoods for years to come.</narrative>
  </description>
